<section class="section wrap" id="about">
  <div class="section-head reveal"><div><div class="section-index">01 / THE PERSON</div><h2>More than just<br>lines of code.</h2></div><p class="section-intro">I’m interested in technology that feels useful, works reliably, and solves real problems — not just demos that look good.</p></div>
  <div class="about-grid">
