    <article class="card about-card reveal"><div class="card-label">WHAT I'M DRAWN TO</div><h3>Intersections worth exploring.</h3><p>The most interesting work often happens where different disciplines overlap. These are the areas I'm actively exploring and developing through hands-on practice.</p><div class="focus-list"><div class="focus-item"><span class="focus-icon">⌘</span><span>Building practical software projects</span></div><div class="focus-item"><span class="focus-icon">◈</span><span>AI assistants, agents, and knowledge systems</span></div><div class="focus-item"><span class="focus-icon">⌁</span><span>UI/UX, interaction, and visual polish</span></div><div class="focus-item"><span class="focus-icon">◎</span><span>Tools that help people focus and learn</span></div></div></article>
  </div>
</section>

